# sha256 over the document with line endings normalised to LF, which is how git stores
# it. A raw digest of the working tree disagrees with this record on a Windows checkout
# and agrees on a POSIX one, so it would fire by operating system rather than by
# content. Verify with mds650.rp2.run_manifest.normalised_digest, or on an LF checkout
# with: sha256sum -c LEVEL4_PREREGISTRATION.sha256
2ebfb745a4e608fdc1c554336f63dbfa24018b9d249ab2e1f54eaa266b5ed9b9  LEVEL4_PREREGISTRATION.md
